        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Yengo Isorgee khutshem singna nganli",
            "Sembiba Mapu ngairi leisi leithonna,",
            "Langtaknei uning bana anouba taibangdu;",
            "Loinana anouba onlani.",
            "",
            "Oh taibang mi oi, hougat lak lo",
            "Amamba thadok lo",
            "Chang jarak lo nang mangan duda",
            "Taibang nasu pao phongdok ri",
            "",
            "2. Yengo Isorgee khutsem singna ngan li",
            "Ngai duna lei Isorgee meesing phongdokpa",
            "Isorna taibang se nouba semkhraba tungda",
            "Marupki leipham kadom no.",
            "",
            "3. Yengo Isorgee khutsem singna nganli",
            "Atia maksu chajikgum paithok lagani;",
            "Isorna taibang nouna semkhraba numitta,",
            "Nahak ki leipham chang gadra."
          ]
        }
      }
